From 3c33030959e3f1858b58ab9abdd0f65a784367a2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 02:22:41 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] sim: v850: Add the RH850 G4KH instructions

The simulator stopped on instructions that GCC and RH850 startup code
now use. Add LDL and STC, the sync instructions, CLIP and the other G4KH
instructions.

Signed-off-by: Parthiban Nallathambi <parthiban@linumiz.com>
---
